[b]What's next[/b]
[list]
[*]Start-up under 10 seconds and smoother frame pacing
[*]More interface and parity work toward the original client
[*]Longer play sessions, reconnects and world hopping
[*]Bring the boss studies into the game (animation format, NPC definitions, clean-up)
